You said you were looking for a nymph - well why not polymorph
yourself into one!   Hey what an idea!  This is actually a rather
standard way of getting rid of cursed objects.

The Vampire lord can pick things up while levitating because his
INTRINSIC levitation allows him to do this - wearing a ring of 
levitation is a totally different type of levitation and does
not allow this.

